{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.CMBFunctor","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.CMBFunctor","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":13,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CMBFunctor.ofJet","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CMBFunctor.ofJet","kind":"def","line":66,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/CMBFunctor.lean#L66-L84","doc":"**De-axiomatisation (bean `gob0`): a genuine finite direct-sum colimit.**\nOver a finite configuration type, an abelian-group target, and a\njet-quotient assignment `jet : Config → M`, the colimit of the jet\nquotients over a boundary set `S` is realised as the actual direct sum\n`⨁_{c ∈ S} jet c` (the finite `Finset.sum` restricted to `S`). `CMB` is\nthen this genuine colimit composed with the boundary map — `CMB_def` holds\nby `rfl`, so the functor is a real construction, not a free `jetColimit`\nfield. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CMBFunctor.CMB_eq_jetColimit_boundary","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CMBFunctor.CMB_eq_jetColimit_boundary","kind":"theorem","line":59,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/CMBFunctor.lean#L59-L61","doc":"`CMB` is exactly the jet-quotient colimit evaluated on the boundary. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CMBFunctor.CMB_congr_of_boundary","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CMBFunctor.CMB_congr_of_boundary","kind":"theorem","line":53,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/CMBFunctor.lean#L53-L57","doc":"`CMB` factors through the horizon map: aeons with the same boundary have\nthe same CMB value (the functor depends only on `∂`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CMBFunctor.CMB_def","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CMBFunctor.CMB_def","kind":"theorem","line":47,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/CMBFunctor.lean#L47-L47","doc":"`CMB = (jet-quotient colimit) ∘ ∂`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CMBFunctor.CMB","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CMBFunctor.CMB","kind":"def","line":45,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/CMBFunctor.lean#L45-L45","doc":"The CMB functor. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CMBFunctor.jetColimit","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CMBFunctor.jetColimit","kind":"def","line":43,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/CMBFunctor.lean#L43-L43","doc":"The colimit of the degree-`≥1` jet quotients over a boundary set. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CMBFunctor.boundary","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CMBFunctor.boundary","kind":"def","line":41,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/CMBFunctor.lean#L41-L41","doc":"The horizon / boundary map `∂`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CMBFunctor.instM","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CMBFunctor.instM","kind":"def","line":39,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/CMBFunctor.lean#L39-L39","doc":"`M` is an abelian group (an `R`-module underlying group). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CMBFunctor.M","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CMBFunctor.M","kind":"def","line":37,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/CMBFunctor.lean#L37-L37","doc":"The `Mod_R` target (jet-quotient sections). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CMBFunctor.Config","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CMBFunctor.Config","kind":"def","line":35,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/CMBFunctor.lean#L35-L35","doc":"Ambient configurations. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CMBFunctor.Aeon","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CMBFunctor.Aeon","kind":"def","line":33,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/CMBFunctor.lean#L33-L33","doc":"Aeons `π₀(Bun°)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CMBFunctor.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CMBFunctor.mk","kind":"ctor","line":31,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/CMBFunctor.lean#L31-L31","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CMBFunctor","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CMBFunctor","kind":"structure","line":26,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/CMBFunctor.lean#L26-L47","doc":"Data for the CMB functor.\n\nA `definition` carrier: the aeons and configurations, the abelian-group\ntarget `M = Mod_R`, the horizon map `∂`, the jet-quotient colimit\nassignment, and `CMB` pinned to their composition. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:def:cmb-functor","label":"def:cmb-functor","md":"quantum-observable-universe/information-theory/cmb-functor.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}